raman@umiacs.umd.edu (Dr. Rajeev Raman) writes:
>NH3.1.3; wishing for artifact causes me to 
>"feel something in my hands for an instant, but I can't hold on"
>or something like that.  Experiments in discover mode disprove the
>hypothesis that some artifacts are forbidden to some classes.
>
>What's the scoop?  Inqiring minds want to know.

If there's already an artifact or two in the game, your chances of getting
another by wishing nosedive (not that they were necessarily too good to
start with); also, if artifact X already exists in the game, you can't wish
up another one.

Some artifacts will *damage* some classes when touched, also; be careful.

